{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50598","headline":"句 · 卢嵩","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁晏以爲期。\n（《韦江州集》卷五有韦应物作《酬卢嵩秋夜见寄五韵》，诗末原注曰：「卢诗云岁晏以爲期之句。\n」按卢诗不传，此虽只句，亦弥足珍。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢嵩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}